Is this Celina's report? Thank you very much. We also went through hard times. The specters were contaminating the people and, to protect them, we isolated them in Pillai, which became crowded. We built several shelters across the continent, and the Mages and Shamans raised magic barriers. Pillai was bombarded by Evil Specters, born from the joining of the Black Specters. We took the fight to the ground and nearly lost. But warriors from everywhere came to help us.

Midranda awakened in the Sanctuary of the Abyss, and his troops began moving inside the sanctuary's barrier.
Aaaah! All this chaos because Yagditha helped him.
You did your best! Now we must get ready!

